+   [S1, unofficial]
+9. **Accumulate Color:** Repeat steps 3-8 for $k$ samples (using stratified sampling for lower variance) and accumulate the color estimate. The color estimate is:
+   $$ C(r) = \sum_{j=1}^k w_j c_r(t_j) $$
